---
description: Testing expectations
alwaysApply: true
---

- Put unit tests next to the module as `*.test.ts` or `*.test.tsx`.
- Put browser journeys in `tests/e2e`.
- Cover validation, access denial, and the register, private page, profile, and sign-out path when those behaviors change.
- Do not skip or weaken a failing test to make CI pass.
- Pre-commit runs lint-staged only. The full suite stays in CI.
